      "text": "The observable universe contains an"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.05125,
      "end": 11.329916,
      "text": "estimated range of celestial bodies and"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.355958,
      "end": 12.553873999999999,
      "text": "distant light sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.900083,
      "end": 16.087582,
      "text": "All stars are formed from collapsing clouds"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.100625,
      "end": 17.910541000000002,
      "text": "of gas and dust known as molecular"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.936541,
      "end": 18.457373999999998,
      "text": "clouds."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.768083,
      "end": 22.007666,
      "text": "Astronomers state that all stars like our"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.033708,
      "end": 23.908707,
      "text": "sun are always born with a sibling."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.228083,
      "end": 27.064041,
      "text": "Many other stars are visible to the"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.077041,
      "end": 28.522374,
      "text": "naked eye at night across the"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.535375000000002,
      "end": 29.459875,
      "text": "constellations."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.808083000000003,
      "end": 32.72216600000001,
      "text": "As atoms at the core become helium,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.9305,
      "end": 34.623208000000005,
      "text": "stars like the Sun begin to fuse"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.64925,
      "end": 35.248208000000005,
      "text": "hydrogen."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.580083,
      "end": 38.767583,
      "text": "The lifecycle of high mass stars diverges"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.793625,
      "end": 41.020208000000004,
      "text": "from low mass stars after carbon fusion."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.352083,
      "end": 44.461499,
      "text": "Neutron stars are the second smallest and"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.4875,
      "end": 46.427624,
      "text": "second densest known class of stellar"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.453666,
      "end": 47.013582,
      "text": "objects."
    }
  ],
